    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** The top-line environment remains challenging, with revenues continuing to contract as end-market demand stays subdued. However, the company is successfully offsetting this weakness through internal efficiency gains, leading to notable margin expansion. The earnings beats and raised guidance highlight that while external demand headwinds persist, the underlying cost structure and operational leverage are improving, shifting the profit trajectory ahead of the topline recovery.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is delivering a clear beat-and-raise execution story, prioritizing margin discipline over volume. The decision to lift full-year profit and EBITDA guidance, even as sales remain under pressure, signals strong cost control and operational rigor. This has bolstered market credibility, prompting multiple analyst upgrades. The sustained dividend underlines a commitment to shareholder returns while the team manages through a soft cycle, reinforcing a narrative of steady, self-help progress.",
